# 统一行尾符策略：文本文件在仓库内统一存 LF，检出时按平台自动转换（Windows=CRLF，Mac/Linux=LF）
* text=auto

# 二进制文件不进行行尾转换
*.db binary
*.dll binary
*.exe binary
*.so binary
*.dylib binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary

# Windows 脚本/项目文件固定 CRLF（仓库内仍存 LF）
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.cs text eol=crlf
*.csproj text eol=crlf
*.md text eol=crlf
